.SS "void csmp::IndexTracker::Attach (\fBcsmp::Index\fP * newIndex, const \fBcsmp::Index\fP * existingIndex)"

.PP
Called when a new \fBIndex\fP is copied using an existing \fBIndex\fP\&. Attaches an existing index object to a new index\&. Reports if the existing index object is orphan, i\&.e\&. has no name because it has not been tracked before\&.

.PP
In this case, the parameter is called 'unspecified'\&. This will be picked up by the property database at the next update attempt\&. 
